ive Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_GGVC__100:AF1","text":"Definitio hierarchiae → distinctio principis et multitudinis → tres modi cognitionis angelicae → tres hierarchiae → tres ordines in unaquaque → fundamentum naturale et gratuitum → appropriatio nominum → ordinatio novem graduum → permanentia eschatologica → assumptio hominum secundum gloriam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0070","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0090","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0120","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0148","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0166","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_GGVC__100:AF2","text":"Obiectio ex apparentia unitatis vel contradictionis → distinctio respectuum et modorum attributionis → concessio limitata → restitutio ordinis pluriformis sub principio uno.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_GGVC__100:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"